{"text": "3-2-1 Race-it! is an arcade-inspired racing game.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The core feature of 3-2-1 Race-it! is that players can race on a track to beat their high score and be included on the leaderboard.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Players have a selection of racetracks and challenges to test their skills.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The funding goal for 3-2-1 Race-it! was $21,184.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
