{"text": "The funding period for 3-2-1 Race-it! was from February 27, 2025, to March 29, 2025.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Players can create their own tracks by driving around in maps, finding the best spot, adding structures, and recording their racetrack.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
