{"text": "The vision for the game is to focus on racing, beating high scores, and creating new race tracks.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
