{"text": "The game will contain enough content to be enjoyable at the early access release.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "More content will be added during early access based on community feedback.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "km11__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
